window.products.push({"id":560077,"name":"Bretani 24 oz Stainless Steel Coffee Canister & Scoop Set, Dark Gray - Large Airtight Kitchen Storage Container for Storing Coffee Beans & Grounds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ocaNpuhxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get ready to experience the best coffee you've ever tasted. Storing coffee correctly minimizes aroma and flavor loss. The key to maximizing freshness is protecting your coffee grounds and beans against unwanted exposure to moisture, light, and air. Bretani's coffee storage canister does just that. Designed with a tightly sealed, airtight lid and crafted from premium stainless steel. Light and moisture are blocked, locking in freshness, and extending the shelf life of your favorite roasted blends.  Bretani's coffee canisters are designed with an innovative, WICOVALVE one-way filter. This unique filter valve allows CO2 gas to be slowly released and at the same time, blocks oxygen from entering, keeping your stored coffee fresh. Properly storing your coffee grounds and beans protects them from going stale prematurely.  Featuring a sleek, modern stainless steel design, our Bretani coffee canister can be displayed on a countertop or tucked away in a cabinet or pantry. It is not a good idea to store your coffee in the refrigerator or freezer, as this will create too much moisture, destroying the flavor and aroma of your coffee grounds and beans. Keep track of your coffee purchase or expiry date with the canister’s convenient, built-in date tracking calendar wheel. Simply select the date and never worry about the freshness of your roasted blends.  Includes: 24-oz. Coffee Canister, Stainless Steel Measuring Scoop, and CO2 WICOVALVES  At Bretani, we are passionate about all things coffee. We proudly offer luxury coffee products and accessories to help you brew the perfect cup. We are dedicated to providing exceptional quality products every fellow coffee connoisseur desires.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ocaNpuhxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bretani","source_asin":"B07PWB4YSD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560077","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PWB4YSD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PWB4YSD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
