window.products.push({"id":560305,"name":"Comfort Gifts for Women | Funny Get Well Soon Gift Set with Mug, Tea Strainer, Socks. Feel Better Gift Basket, Sick Friend Care Package, Thinking of Y","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.19,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZFk9z3cGL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"LAUGHTER IS THE BEST MEDICINE: Think of a sick friend, family member or coworker, how do you get them to smile and uplift their spirits during a tough time? This \"Hey You Hot Tea\" feel better gifts for women will surely make them laugh and speed up recovery. Our thinking of you gifts for women are designed to bring smiles to your cared ones going through low moments, may it be illness, surgery recovery, loss of a job or heartbreaks. COZY SOCKS FOR WOMEN: The perfect get better soon care package accessory for someone who needs to relax and recover after surgery. Our comfy socks will definitely keep their feet warm while recovering and healing. Clove Lane exclusive novelty socks feature the \"Hey You Hot Tea\" quote and a funny hidden message: “If you can read this, bring me some tea”. The vibrant colors will surely brighten up the day of a loved one going through tough times. COFFEE & TEA CUP AND ACCESSORIES: Our 15oz extra large mug is a must have for people on the mend so they can enjoy more of a healing hot beverage. This care package for women also includes a premium mesh ball tea steeper made of 304 food grade stainless steel, the tea lover’s favorite tea infuser for a loose tea delight! Clove Lane comfort gifts for women are the ideal surgery recovery gifts to show someone who is sick that you are thinking of them. UNIQUE GET WELL GIFTS FOR WOMEN: Give these beautiful cozy gifts for women to your mom, aunt, sister, wife, best friend, girlfriend, teacher, grandmother and comfort a special lady in your life, including yourself. It makes a great tea and coffee lovers gift alone or in addition to a get well soon gift basket or corporate gifts for clients and employees. Beautiful giftable box ready to give, no wrap needed. BACKED UP BY OUR 100% LOVE IT GUARANTEE: Make a special lady in your life unbox happiness with our cheer up gifts for women. Send a message or a thoughtful gesture with our warm and cozy gifts. We want yourself and your loved ones to absolutely love our feel better gifts for women. If for some reason you don’t love our coffee and tea gift set, please return for a no questions asked refund. Give the get well tea care package that will make your cared ones smile.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZFk9z3cGL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Clove Lane Gifts","source_asin":"B0BNP4V5KR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560305","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNP4V5KR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNP4V5KR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":560306,"name":"12 Pack of 3.5 Inch Valance Clips for Window Blinds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.31,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jHR6+zMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We have a variety of valance clips for different sized valances! These clips are meant to attach to your valance and then clasp over onto the metal headrail that's located on the top of your blind. You need to use at least 2 valance clips per valance. For instance if you have 3 valances that are less than 32\" wide each and that are loosely hanging off your blind, you will need a total of 6 individual valance clips to replace the ones you currently have. Luckily, we sell packs of 6 valance clips! We also carry packs that contain 12 and 24 clips! RECOMMENDED: USE 2 VALANCE CLIPS PER VALANCE THAT IS 32\" WIDE OR LESS. USE 3 VALANCE CLIPS PER VALANCE THAT IS 33\" TO 48\" WIDE. USE 4 VALANCE CLIPS PER VALANCE THAT IS 49\" TO 64\" WIDE. USE 5 VALANCE CLIPS PER VALANCE THAT IS 65\" TO 80\" WIDE.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jHR6+zMkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Blinds Supply","source_asin":"B07BN6N3Y8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BN6N3Y8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BN6N3Y8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
