window.products.push({"id":560355,"name":"Citronella Scented Lamp Oil, 3 Liter - Smokeless and Odorless Insect and Mosquito Repellent Paraffin Lamp Oil for Indoor and Outdoor Lanterns, Torches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nPcLFIIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This unique Shabbat Candle oil is infused with citronella oil so you not only have stunning candles but also have the peace and quiet of a bug and mosquito free holiday table! No matter if you are lighting them indoors or outdoors, your candles will repel bugs, offer a clean smokeless burn, and provide a odorless Shabbat candle experience! PRODUCT FEATURES: Citronella Scented Paraffin Smokeless Odor Free For Indoor and Outdoor Use Great for Tiki Torches, Lanterns, Oil Candles For Shabbat Candles and Religious Candles KEEPS BUGS AWAY Everyone loves a great outdoor picnic or barbecue. The problem is those pesky flying bugs and mosquitoes that ruin the fun. With this lamp oil, you can keep the party bug and mosquito free! Infused with citronella oil, fling creatures will hate this lamp oil and want to stay far away. CLEAN BURNING Much as insects hate this oil, you will love it! Is a clean smokeless, odorless burn that is barely noticeable. Perfect for parties and events, this paraffin fuel is great to use in centerpiece oil candles and other decorative purposes. This lamp oil can also be used to light Shabbat and Holiday candles, as well religious candles in Synagogues and churches. ABOUT NER MITZVAH Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert candle-maker, delivering a wide selection of products at the highest quality with personal customer service. Count on us for Shabbat, Havdalah, and Chanukah candles and oil lamps as well as related Judaica.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nPcLFIIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ner Mitzvah","source_asin":"B07RSCD9QP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RSCD9QP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RSCD9QP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":560356,"name":"Moringa Plant Live Seedling 6-11\" Malunggay Shobhanjana Miracletree drumstick Tree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+F0K27USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy to grow as an annual in the north or south as a perennial. Contains 46 antioxidants, 18 amino acids & is a complete protein. This is a very special dwarf variety from India. Unlike other varieties of moringa, this tree will remain short and is very well suited to container growing, which makes growing it in the U.S. much easier. Moringa is native to the tropics and the subtropics; container growing will allow you to bring your tree inside for the winter. This plant is prized for its very high-protein leaves, its rich concentration of minerals and vitamins, and its heavy load of anti-oxidants! Leaves, blooms, seeds and immature seedpods, called “drumsticks”, are edible; seeds are source of a high-quality oil. Moringa is an important food source in some parts of the world. Because it can be grown cheaply and easily, and the leaves retain lots of vitamins and minerals when dried, moringa is used in India and Africa in feeding programs to fight malnutrition. The immature green pods (drumsticks) are prepared similarly to green beans, while the seeds are removed from more mature pods and cooked like peas or roasted like nuts. The leaves are cooked and used like spinach, and they are also dried and powdered for use as a condiment. The seed cake remaining after oil extraction is used as a fertilizer and also to purify well water and to remove salt from seawater.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+F0K27USL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Unknown","source_asin":"B09D2LHLMR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D2LHLMR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D2LHLMR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
