window.products.push({"id":560486,"name":"Milk Frother, Handheld Frother Electric Whisk, Milk Foamer, Mini Drink Mixer, Coffee Blender Frother with Stainless Steel Whisk for Lattes, Cappuccino","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IC7pykrOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BEAUTIFUL STYLED & VERSATILITY: The electric foam maker is beautifully styled in different colors to fit into any modern kitchen.One mini mixer for your different whisking and mixing needs. Not only creates milk foam for coffees,cappuccinos,and macchiatos, but is also suitable for making hot and cold chocolate,milkshakes,matcha tea,mixed drinks,nutritious protein powder drinks and even for whisking egg and sauces. Use it to make milkshakes for your kids and family or cocktails for your friends FAST & CONVENIENT: Ergonomically designed with a handheld size soft-to-touch body that just press the power button once to start frothing. Make rich, beautiful, smooth, creamy froth in seconds. Easy to make delicious foamy creamer for your latte, cappuccino, macchiato or hot chocolate at home with your milk frother. This portable High speed handheld milk frother is definitely a good kitchen gadget for all avid coffee and tea drinkers PREMIUM & TRUSTED QUALITY: A lightweight handheld milk foamer comes with a powerful motor, easy and comfortable BPA free handle, and durable food safe stainless-steel spiral whisk that won't rust or break over time. Our small and efficient frother works on all types of milk - half and half, creamer, soy, almond, hazelnut, cashew, whole milk, and other dairy such as butter or cream. Protable size is convenient to carry makes sure you can enjoy your morining coffee although in traveling EASY TO CLEAN & STORE: Cleanup for this matcha coffee frother is even faster. Just put the whisk in mild soapy water or hot running water and briefly turn it on, then instantly clean. When stored on counter or table, it sits nicely next other coffee accessories. Our powerful and durable hand-held milk frother is powered by two AA batteries with a compact electric design that easily fits in a drawer GREAT GIFTS CHOICE: The sturdy coffee milk frother is so handy and useful that can brings you no hassle. This portable handheld milk frother is a perfect gift for you to your friends and family. Let them enjoy the convenience of making chocolate or cappuccino at home as well as in travel. We are confident of our product and know you will like it. Just order now and start to create thick and creamy foam for your homemade drinks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IC7pykrOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BC BRUNO CAVALLI","source_asin":"B0B8DVD8HH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8DVD8HH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8DVD8HH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
