window.products.push({"id":560491,"name":"FLAT Small Portable Collapsible Foldable Electric Travel Kettle - Fast Boil Auto Reheat Feature - Travel Size Small Electric Tea/Coffee Water Boiler -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wE3u2ZtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy your relaxing time- you earned it For moments that last longer The hard times are over, and now it is your turn to relax. Share a nice cup of your favorite warm beverage with your closest people before you go on with your journey. Create lasting memories and enjoy the conversations over the scent of tea, coffee, hot chocolate. 🦅 Enjoy your freedom- have your favorite beverage whenever you want For everyone, and you No matter where you are-in a van, at a hotel or a hostel, in an airport, on top of the highest mountains, at a camp, at a family party, in your office, or just simply at home - and no matter what you are doing- making your midnight drink or cooking an instant dinner, or waiting for the sun to rise, or your plane to arrive - this kettle is with you at any time, and made for every occasion.🌃 Enjoy the silent moments- take your timeFor times when quietness is neededSometimes we appreciate the quiet moments in our life. It might have gotten dark, and the people around you might be sleeping already. Now, you have the opportunity to drink your warm beverage almost noiselessly. The soft blue light illuminates your beverage just enough, so you can pour the water without spilling. We thought of every scenario as this kettle was made.🔎 Give it a try- you can send it backFor if we made mistakesIf anything happens, reach out to us and tell us what happened. We can send you a new one and do our best to make you happy. If you didn’t like it, tell us so, and we will fix the issue. We are with you, and you have earned to receive the best product.🤝Thank you- for choosing FLATFor you, who read all thisI wish you long lasting memories, the most relaxing times and great new experiences and journeys with the kettle!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51wE3u2ZtVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FLAT","source_asin":"B09H74LQQ7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09H74LQQ7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09H74LQQ7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
