window.products.push({"id":560517,"name":"Catnapper Power Lift Full Lay-Out Recliner with Comfort Coil Seating - Soft and durable polyester fabric - Elegant button back design (Slate) - Weight","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9110IeXZuGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Thing That Makes Older Adults' Lives Easier. As we age, it becomes harder for us to move like we did during our youthful years. We also start to appreciate comfort and the incredible combination of comfort and convenience. Whether you're losing the range of motion you once had or simply want a better way to relax, there's something that will make living room conversation, movie watching, reading and relaxing more comfortable and convenient than ever before. That something is a power lift chair or medical recliner. Decades ago, the technology used in today's power lift chairs didn't exist. Now more than ever, they're more comfortable and desirable to anyone with a physical handicap or need for more convenient comfort. Their popularity and effectiveness have been proven even further since their entrance into the medical recliner market. If this type of chair didn't make lives of older adults better they would have never entered the market. The new chair by Catnapper is called the “Pow’r Lift” Chair. Catnapper will create higher competition that will, in effect, cause lift chair companies to create better products and offer them at more affordable prices. Because technology is at its peak right now in the medical recliner market, the most comfortable and convenient chairs are available at the \"add to cart\" yellow button on the top right of this page. Buy NOW and get FREE SHIPPING.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9110IeXZuGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bWise USA","source_asin":"B01DT8M0HU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560517","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DT8M0HU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DT8M0HU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
