window.products.push({"id":560718,"name":"Ezetek Cordless Vacuum Cleaner with LED Display, 5 in 1 Cordless Stick Vacuum Cleaner, Wireless Vacuum Cleaner with Detachable Battery, Stick Vacuum C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":98.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u10Vb8fWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Long-lasting Battery & 2 Power Modes】Our 57 Wh high capacity battery powered cordless vacuum cleaner can generate 50 AW strong suction. Cordless stick vacuum with LED touch display to switch between two power modes: standard mode (15KPa for 45 mins), highest mode (25KPa for 20 mins). 2 adjustable speed levels meet your different cleaning needs and allow full use of the battery. Detachable Battery can be charged in 4 hours in the unit or desktop and doubles the runtime if you buy an additional battery. 【Low Noise & Ultra Lightweight】The handheld cordless vacuum weights only 3.2LBS. You can easily use it for one hand cleaning without suffering from back problems. User-friendly for most ages. The low noise design is friendly to pets and babies. 【Led Headlights & Flexible Maneuverable Brush】The bright LED headlights let you reach into dark areas and narrow spaces so you won't miss any dust. Flexible 150°swivel sideways and 90°up and down brush head let you freely clean the house in all direction. 【Multiple Accessories & Multifunction】Ezetek Vacuum cleaner includes one dusting brush for cleaning the dusty surface such as curtains, clothes or keyboards, lamps, blinds. One 2 in 1 crevice tool for those hard-to-reach corners. And one mattress brush for bed, sofa and pet hair. You can easily use these accessories to convert our stick vacuum cleaner into handheld vacuum. All our accessories can hang on the wall together with the vacuum cleaner host, saving you storage space. 【Washable Air Purification HEPA Filtration】This lightweight wireless vacuum has powerful cyclone and advanced 4-stages HEPA filtration system. 1.1 Qt dust capacity captures more dust and pet hair at one time. You can easily empty the dustbin with a one-button press. HEPA filter is washable and recyclable. Regular cleaning of HEPA filter can prevent suction loss and blockage, maintain good suction. (Note: Please use the filter after it totally dry.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61u10Vb8fWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ezetek","source_asin":"B0BVDW6M4V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560718","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVDW6M4V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVDW6M4V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
