window.products.push({"id":560723,"name":"Fluff You, You Fluffin Fluff - 11oz Ceramic Coffee Mug - Funny Cup For Crazy Cat Ladies - Grumpy Cat Lover Gifts - Cute Unique Cat Mom Gifts For Birth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GOtJtCsuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Purr-fect Mug for Cat Ladies and Cat Gentlemen: This purr-fectly affordable, totally adorable ceramic stoneware cat mug is great gift for a mom, dad, boyfriend/girlfriend, son, daughter, friend, boss, co-worker, or anyone else who loves cats. Show your gratitude and appreciation for that special someone with the cute Fluff You, You Fluffin’ Fluff mug that shows they’re all about that cat life. Lasting Quality: High-quality, smooth ceramic stoneware resists scratches and lasts a long time. The custom imprint is permanent and won’t lose its luster or fade. Your stoneware ceramic mug can be used with either hand since the Fluff You, You Fluffin’ Fluff design is printed on two sides. Good for Any Occasion; with an 11-ounce capacity, these mugs hold plenty of liquid and make great gifts for all of your special occasions: anniversaries, bachelor and bachelorette parties, and birthdays. Safe for the Microwave and Dishwasher: Use your mug again and again in the microwave. Wash it in the dishwasher after every use and still never worry about the design fading away or peeling over time. Cold and hot temperatures will not affect the high quality of your ceramic stoneware mug, so you’ll feel confident to use it every day. Though simple, this cute cat mug makes a thoughtful gift for anyone on their birthday, Christmas, Hanukkah, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day, or any special occasion. Fun Way to Break the Ice: Your new ceramic coffee cup displays Fluff You, You Fluffin’ Fluff on both sides so you can both laugh over your coffee or tea in the morning. The double-sided design makes an ideal gift for a new bride and groom or a wonderful housewarming present. Surprise your spouse with this cute, thoughtful gift for your anniversary or any time you want to show you care. Carefully Packed, Satisfaction Is Guaranteed: 100% customer satisfaction is our goal. To make sure each ceramic mug arrives at its new home safe and sound. Our durable new packaging delivers the high-quality mugs to you reliably. If you ever find a craftsmanship or materials defect in any of our mugs, simply contact our friendly and responsive customer service folks. We stand behind all of our carefully crafted and packed products and will work with you to find a solution that’s pleasing to you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GOtJtCsuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crazy Bros Tees","source_asin":"B06X1BDQL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560723","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06X1BDQL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06X1BDQL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
