window.products.push({"id":560739,"name":"Aemygo Wall Mount Commercial Soap Dispenser, Stainless Steel Bathroom Soap Accessories, Refillable Kitchen Utensils for Hotels Restaurant Schools Heal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314+vg-5zEL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Details:  The Soap dispenser has a wide range of applications, you can use it in restaurants, hotels, offices, public toilets, bathrooms, KTV, etc.  We will send you glue, screws, expansion tubes, and a small retractable funnel, complete with accessories.  We have both perforated and glued mounting options for easy installation.  Steps for Perforated Installation:  1. Placing the base in the installation position and mark the place where the holes are punched.  2. Punching holes with an electric drill.  3. Knocking in the expansion tube.  4. Putting the base, tighten the screws.  5. Inserting the soap dispenser from the upper port.  6. Finished!  No-punch Installation Method:  1. Applying nail-free adhesive to the base plate.  2. Pressing onto the wall and use items such as tape to aid fixing. And waiting 72 hours for the glue to cure.  3. Aligning the soap dispenser with the base, and insert it into the rear fixing negative.  4. Finished!  Warm Tip:  The no-punch installation method is suitable for smooth tiles, convex tiles, smooth marble, glass walls, metal walls, and solid wood walls.  However, it is not suitable for painted walls, plaster walls, concrete walls, and wallpaper walls.  Size Information:  Capacity: 1000ml/33.8oz Package size:  Length: 12.2cm/4.8inch Width: 12.4cm/4.8inch Height: 20.7cm/8.15inch Soap Dispenser Size:  Length: 12cm/4.72inch Width: 5.5cm/2.17inch Height: 20.3cm/7.99inch Pump Size:  High: 3cm/1.18inch The Package Contains:  1*Stainless steel soap dispenser  1*Fixing bracket  3*Expansion tubes  3*Screws  1*Glue  1* Small retractable funnel  After-sales Service:  If you have any questions about our Stainless steel soap dispenser,  please feel free to contact us, and we will give you a satisfactory ans","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314+vg-5zEL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aemygo","source_asin":"B09B513KFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560739","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B513KFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B513KFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
