window.products.push({"id":560855,"name":"SEAGOLDEN 3D Butterfly Wall Decor | Gold Butterfly Room Decor | Gold Butterflies Boho Party Decorations | Paper Butterflies for Cake Decorating | Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xYNSpi3EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create a beautiful arrangement of room decor butterflies with these gold butterfly decorations. They can be used as removable sticker wall decor for baby nurseries, bedroom wall decoration, closet wall decorations and wedding wall decor. Curate an office space with rustic boho decor garden vibes or add a butterfly wall decal to the girls’ bedroom wall decorations for a touch of magic. Perfect gold wall decals for weddings decorations, butterfly gold baby showers and cake butterfly decorations for parties. This butterfly pack can also be used without the sticker in a wedding butterflies centerpiece, weaved into a small butterflies decor floral arrangement or placed as gold butterfly decor on top of party cupcakes. These elegant and small butterfly stickers are a versatile set.   APPLICATION  Conditions should be as dry as possible so the paper butterfly doesn’t lose its shape. To prepare for adhering the wall stickers butterfly, surface must be cleaned, dry, smooth and free of dust. These butterfly wall decor stickers tack well and peel off without damage or leaving residue. They can be gently peeled and repositioned as needed to create an eye catching design.   NOTES 1. If applying wall decor butterflies to a freshly painted wall, wait 1 month until adding the butterfly decal for best adhesion. 2. Gently use a butterknife to loosen the gold wall stickers for removal. 3. Room lighting and monitor settings may cause slight color difference in the hue of the shimmery paper. It can appear more like pink and gold butterflies depending on the lighting or a white and gold butterfly because of the shimmer.   SATISFACTION D  If you are not satisfied with these butterfly stickers for wall gold decor for any reason, please contact us within 30 days and return the undamaged butterfly sticker to get a full refund or replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xYNSpi3EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEAGOLDEN","source_asin":"B08XB3PK5Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XB3PK5Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XB3PK5Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":560856,"name":"Decodyne Shot Flask - 8oz Flask with a Built-in Collapsible Shot Glass - Stainless Steel - Premium Leather Wrapping (Brown Leather)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91d4p7i35-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A gentleman is never unprepared and that means always having a fine spirit tucked away in a flask for those moments that deserve a toast with a shot. But drinking right from the flask? Now, that's completely uncivilized! Gentlemen know that the only proper way to sip a spirit is from a proper shot glass, but who wants to carry a bulky glass right in their pocket? With the Shot Flask, your problems are solved! The Shot Flask is a unique luxury gift flask that combines a standard hip flask and a collapsible drinking cup. When you're on the go, the cup stays neatly folded and tucked away right in the front of the flask. When it's time to enjoy a drink, just pull the stainless steel shot glass out of the slot, expand it and pour! It's never been easier to serve a real shot right from the flask. Made from premium stainless steel, the Shot Flask is very durable and sturdy. The stainless steel won't corrode or rust, and it's nonreactive, so it won't alter the taste of spirits. Large enough to hold 8 ounces, the flask is wrapped with genuine leather, giving it an air of luxury and class that is undeniable. A hinged lid makes it easy to open and close the flask and stays tightly closed to prevent leaks and spills. The shot glass is sized for a double pour with its 2-ounce capacity. Backed by a 1-year warranty, the Shot Flask is a barware gift that can be enjoyed for years. It's a popular gift for Father's Day, college graduations, birthdays and the winter holiday. The shot flask is also a unique choice of gifts for groomsmen or a special surprise for anyone who enjoys fine spirits. Truly a conversation piece, the flask is the perfect gift for the man who has everything.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91d4p7i35-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decodyne","source_asin":"B012E1YOLI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012E1YOLI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012E1YOLI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
