window.products.push({"id":560944,"name":"Deni 9700 Electric 5-Quart Pressure Cooker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CvHZuEXEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Deni Pressure Cooker is safe and simple to use. With this multi-function appliance, you can pressure cook using 3 settings, slow cook, steam and brown. Shorten cooking time by up to 70%. Slow cook fork tender stew in 30 minutes, roasts in under an hour, and fruits and vegetables in minutes. Pressurized steam cooks healthy meals in less time than conventional methods. The pressure cooker combines steam, heat, and pressure while retaining the nutrients and flavor of the food. The removable 5 quart non-stick cooking pot provides even heat distribution while the brushed stainless steel housing remains cool to the touch. Pressure cooker is equipped with a fully programmable timer and a delay function of up to 8 hours. Built in thermostat for automatic temperature control and a steam release valve that allows pressure to be released quickly. Comes with 4 built in safety features: The locking pin prevents lid from being opened while under pressure, Automatic shut off valve, pressure regulator knob, and an internal pressure release system. The 5 -quart non stick cooking pot is easy to clean. Instruction book and recipes included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CvHZuEXEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deni","source_asin":"B000A6JKZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560944","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000A6JKZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000A6JKZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":560945,"name":"4 Pcs Boho Abstract Shower Curtain Sets with Non-Slip Rug, Toilet Lid Cover and Bath Mat, Mid Century Waffle Weave Shower Curtain with 12 Hooks, Moder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fNAUE8iAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Waffle Weave Shower Curtain】The boho shower curtain is made of heavy duty polyester fabric, which contains good effect of water repellent. This abstract shower curtain adopted new waffle weave weaving technology, which let water glide off and quick to dry. Durable for long-lasting use. Comes with weighted hem, drapes well. 【Boho Bathroom Set】 The strong enhanced non-slip boho bath mat / U type rug is made of flannel, which is soft, highly absorbent, durable, no smell and safe for your family. Adopted premium TPR on the back to avoid slipping. 【HD Printing】This bathroom sets with shower curtain and rugs adopted high-definition print technology featuring vivid colors, crisp lines and delicate hemming. This modern shower curtain will fit in any kind of bathroom decoration, bring rich nature breath and sense of graceful to your bathroom and simple tranquil experience to your family. 【Larger Sizes】The heavy duty thick fabric shower curtain: 70\" L × 69\" W, O shape toilet lid cover: 16.5\" L × \" 14.6\" W, Thickened bathroom mat sizes: 23.6\" L × 15.7\" W, U shape rug sizes: 17.7\" L × 15.8\" W. The white abstract shower curtain sets with rugs and accessories fit most standard bathroom. 【Easy to Install】We gifted 12 strong hooks for easily installment. Our toilet lid cover have sturdy elastic band on the back allow it to stay in place when you lift it. 【Easy to Care】This bathroom sets with shower curtain and rugs is easy to care. Hand wash or machine wash with cold water, hang to dry. Soak in the water then air-dry to get rid of wrinkles or simply iron on a low temperature to heat the backside.Please feel free to contact us if there is any problem during using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fNAUE8iAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alishomtll","source_asin":"B0B3R76LPQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560945","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3R76LPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3R76LPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
