window.products.push({"id":560949,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler, 42 Inch Tower Fan with Cooling Function, 1.3 Gallon Water Tank, 50° Oscillating 2 In 1 Swamp Cooler, 3 Speed & 3 Mode, 12H Tim","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j1P33pNdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2-IN-1 EVAPORATIVE AIR COOLER】 Sunday Living evaporative air cooler is a combination of fan's air circulation and humidifier's purification function. Comes with the 1.3 gallon water tank, it can create cold airflow and the process of evaporation of water in turn humidifies dry air. You can enjoy the cool and humid air and experience the desired cooling effect on this hot summer day. 【3 WIND & 3 SPEED SETTING】This swamp cooler comes with 3 wind speed settings (low/middle/high) to give all the comfort you need. 3 types of the wind(normal/sleep/natural), no matter you are working, sleeping or doing something else, it will help you to choose the best wind. The sleep mode can intelligently help you adjust the wind speed, to ensure that you can enjoy a comfortable sleep environment. 【QUIET & LARGE OSCILLATION】 This air cooler fan with 50° oscillating angel will allow you to adjust the supply area, making sure whole-space air circulation is in place instead of only blowing air in one direction, every person in the room can enjoy the cool air, and efficiently circulate the air around the room healthily. 【DUAL CONTROL & BUILT-IN 12H TIMER】 Evaporative cooler is equipped with up to 20 feet remote control and touch panel can conveniently turn on/off the fan and switch any mode you want from everywhere in the room. Timer control function up to 12 hours, so no worries about leaving the cooler on when you go out or have any activities. 【PORTABLE & SPACE SAVING DESIGN】Standing 42 inches tall with a small 7 x 9 inches footprint, the sleek design is easy to fit in corners and tight spaces, which can provide you cool wind and also save your space. The convenient carry handle on the top make this evaporative tower fan easy to move from room to room. A tower fan can be suitable for a variety space: living room, bedroom, dorm and office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71j1P33pNdS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5 SUNDAY LIVING","source_asin":"B08S7HC4X4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-560949","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S7HC4X4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S7HC4X4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
